# Butler Routes - Stormwind City recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes and patterns sold by vendors spawning inside Stormwind City
# (zone 1453), verified against the local Forever game data. 34 recipes
# across 36 vendor links (see docs/city-recipes-inventory.md). Each step is
# gated to its profession; other characters skip it cleanly. No stock-class
# flag exists in the data, so nothing is marked limited.
guide butler-routes-completionist/stormwind-recipes
title Stormwind City - Recipes & Patterns
levels 1-60
zone Stormwind City
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords stormwind, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

